From 7f85eec4a88f22b745b8bf049c8ec72020352298 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:02:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] r4-prep B+: she stays where she landed in the meadow and
 sky-city live boards too (same approach)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

mountBoardGuest is shared: the meadow / sky-city board model is the same region prefab as the journey copy
under RegionJourney-<region>, so her copy goes at journeyModel^-1 x her world transform (scale honoured),
board layer, animation/scripts off, her own renderers only, freed exactly once with the lease. The meadow /
sky-city lease files are untouched (运镜bot's 04->05 / 08->09 work; the 09 plaza file is SHA-frozen by
journey-occlusion): WorldNativeComposition wraps their factories with withRegionBoardGuest. Board cameras
unchanged. Island/tide board is a 2D painting (no 3D space), not changed. Test: lakeside-board-guest.
---
 .../scripts/region/LakesideBoardGuest.ts      | 37 +++++++++++++++----
 .../world-r2/WorldNativeComposition.ts        |  5 ++-
 tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_board_guest.cjs  | 26 ++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

